The Fosian Tigers (a.k.a. the Fosian Dragons or Fosian Little Dragons in Sanese and Zong) are the developed Fosian economies of [[Tondano]]. Between the early 1960s and 2000s, they underwent rapid industrialization and maintained exceptionally high growth rates of more than 8 percent a year. By the early 21st century, these economies had developed into high-income economies, specializing in areas of competitive advantage. Tondano was a categorized as one of the lowest income per-capita country in Fosia post [[Great Adonia War]] and went undergoing a heavy transformation in 1970s. 

